{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLQT7yzJjEsTe4BTLg1S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The merger now re-requests a stale review once per head. `go test ./internal/merger/ ./internal/state/` passes and `go test ./...` showed no failures. `make lint` printed only a parse error in `internal/roles/testdata/docs/skips/src/_x.go`, a fixture this change doesn't touch.\n\n- **Re-request:** when a done review no longer covers the head because code changed, the merger removes that role's `ard:review:<role>:done`, records a new `review_rerequest` event for that PR and head, and logs `merge.review_rerequested`. A head that moved only from `main` still passes `prgate.Covers` and triggers nothing.\n- **Reviewer re-claim:** in `internal/reviewer/candidates.go`, a role with the request label but no done, running or changes label is claimable. Removing `:done` is therefore enough, and I left the reviewer's mark-ready sweep unchanged.\n- **Failures:** if the label removal fails, no event is written and the next tick retries. If the event read fails, the merger makes no re-request and the tick reports the error.\n- **Dry-run:** only the ledger is written and `merge.would_rerequest` is logged. No event is written, so each dry-run tick logs it again. The kill switch needed no code, because the merger loop is already skipped while paused.\n- **Log hint:** the \"fix rounds (#41) will do this\" text is gone. The no-close-out-record case still only logs, with a corrected hint.\n- **Docs:** `docs/proposal.md` and `internal/merger/doc.go` describe the re-request.\n- **Tests:** I added six tests in `internal/merger/loop_test.go` covering the issue's cases and the plan's extra edge cases. I also changed the existing `TestUpdateBranchChangesInvalidateNothingButCodeAfterReviewDoes`, because its first tick now performs the re-request and the old second-tick assertion no longer held.\n\nThe report is at `.ard/252/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":979,"cache_read_input_tokens":46932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":979},"output_tokens":660,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd6c6d47-ab1b-465f-87a4-b9431b243069","uuid":"219e87d5-1cbc-4f2d-9939-b85b2a946f1f","timestamp":"2026-11-23T19:23:12.699Z","request_id":"req_011ChLQT7r3oG8cR36m3sLoD"}
